This project adapts material from LearnHarness
(https://github.com/amosblomqvist/learnharness), which is also licensed under
AGPL-3.0. The adapted parts are portions of playbooks/probe.md,
playbooks/drill.md and docs/method.md. They restate, and in places closely
follow, LearnHarness's prober and teacher prompts and its
docs/teaching-methodology.md.

Modifications: the material was reorganised and extended for learning any
subject with any coding agent (agent-neutral playbooks, a data/ folder for
progress, and track creation with or without an official source). Modified
from November 2026.
